msgid "Automatic uses the selected or uploaded source image’s proportions when they can be detected. Without a source image, the provider chooses its default aspect ratio. Explicit ratios remain provider-dependent."
msgstr "Kiotomatiki hutumia uwiano wa picha asili iliyochaguliwa au iliyopakiwa wakati zinaweza kutambuliwa. Bila picha chanzo, mtoa huduma huchagua uwiano wake chaguomsingi. Uwiano dhahiri unasalia kuwa tegemezi kwa mtoaji."

msgid "1K — faster and lower cost"
msgstr "1K - gharama ya haraka na ya chini"

msgid "2K — higher detail and cost"
msgstr "2K - maelezo ya juu na gharama"

msgid "Automatic chooses the closest supported tier from the source image’s longest edge. Without a source, it uses 1K. Grok Imagine supports 1K and 2K; other providers may map or ignore this setting."
msgstr "Kiotomatiki huchagua kiwango cha karibu kinachotumika kutoka kwa ukingo mrefu zaidi wa picha chanzo. Bila chanzo, hutumia 1K. Grok Imagine inasaidia 1K na 2K; watoa huduma wengine wanaweza ramani au kupuuza mpangilio huu."

msgid "Requests transparency when the provider supports it. Grok applies this as a best-effort text-to-image instruction; image editing and other providers may ignore it."
msgstr "Inaomba uwazi wakati mtoa huduma anaiunga mkono. Grok anatumia hili kama maelekezo bora ya maandishi-kwa-picha; uhariri wa picha na watoa huduma wengine wanaweza kuupuuza."

